    ...    |  ue_index  | No |  the index from tl.ues[],  ${0} in default |
    ...    |  duration  | No |  waiit for ADB log catch,  20s in default |
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...    None
    ...    Example
    ...    |  UE Pre-condition  |  |
    ...    |  UE Attach To GNB With Success Check |  |
    ${model}    _Get UE MODEL    ue_index=${ue_index}
    ${hint}   catenate  This is a new type of UE in CloudRAN Testing, but will still try to attach in old way. If failed,
    ...  pls contact keyword author.
